{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/e55bcd912d0fed358360885ad8ac1453.avif?t=1753315567\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time is your most precious resource.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access the <strong>Seclude </strong>feature at any moment to upgrade your deck,  evolve your cultivation methods, gain EXP or heals\u2014but <strong>every step ages you</strong>. Will you burn bright and fast, or live long enough to ascend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/ac3b28c595d6302a9388f26c5d9899d5.poster.avif?t=1753315567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/ac3b28c595d6302a9388f26c5d9899d5.webm?t=1753315567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/ac3b28c595d6302a9388f26c5d9899d5.mp4?t=1753315567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pixel world. Hand Painted combat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a challenging pixel-art overworld, then clash in <strong>hand-drawn, visually striking battles</strong> that bring your cultivation techniques to life. <strong>No bland animations\u2014just raw, aesthetic power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/e9981f5ba48a40fab76fbd0c101b66d4.poster.avif?t=1753315567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/e9981f5ba48a40fab76fbd0c101b66d4.webm?t=1753315567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so